      "value": "For your information: \n\nSince live 1376, there is similar (but different) problem that avatar stays / appears in the world.\n\nIn 1376, the Avatar Preview is shown correctly so I think those are different than this problem.\n\nHere's list of canny I found about the new problem.\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/closing-menu-leaves-a-floating-avatar-preview\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/avatar-thumbnail-stays\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/avatar-preview-stays",
